From 1a090ccaa793bfd5f80ac3a4402f623597f1c4f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Assistant <assistant@local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:42:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign the video paywall: lock badge, Arabic copy, Cairo
 font, transfer-number field
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

showPayment() in video.js (the panel shown to a signed-in student who
hasn't paid yet):
- Lock icon is now a proper circular badge (.vp-icon-badge) instead of a
  small inline emoji, and the panel is centered instead of left-aligned.
- All UI text for this specific panel is now in Arabic: title, the four
  intro variants (default/rejected/revoked/expired), the input placeholder
  ('Payment reference' -> 'رقم التحويل'), the submit button ('I paid' ->
  'اشترك'), the empty-field validation message, the 'Sending...' status,
  and the hint line. The default intro now reads '...وسيقوم فريق الدعم
  بفتح الدرس' per spec, replacing every 'your teacher will unlock it'
  variant in this panel with 'فريق الدعم' for consistency.
- The admin-configured pay_info instructions (already existed, just plain
  text before) now render right-to-left in the Cairo Google Font via a new
  .vp-pay-ar class; payBlock() takes an explicit 'arabic' flag so this only
  applies here, not to showLogin's pay_info (still English/LTR there).
- Cairo is loaded on demand (only when this panel actually renders, via a
  new loadArabicFont(), same injection-guard pattern as the existing
  injectStyle()) with a safe fallback to the site's normal sans-serif if
  it fails to load.

Applied to both assets/video.js (deployed) and
tools/quiz-maker-v2/assets_templates/video.js (source template, with the
endpoint swapped back to {{DRIVE_ENDPOINT}}) so they stay in sync --
check_asset_drift.py confirms video.js is clean.

Every other panel (showLogin, showPending, showProblem, showNoVideoYet,
the admin-preview badge) is unchanged and stays in English -- only the
payment/subscribe panel was in scope for this request.

Both files verified with node --check. Backend test suite unaffected
(no Code.gs changes).
---
 assets/video.js                               | 64 ++++++++++++++-----
 tools/quiz-maker-v2/assets_templates/video.js | 64 ++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 98 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

